<p>Leap into your mecharachnid, assuming direct control of it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns. While piloting it, all damage dealt is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 19%, 29%, 37%, 43%,</acronym> resistances are increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 17%, 25%, 30%, 34%,</acronym> and all of its talents cooldown twice as fast.</p>